---
description: Test implementation rules
globs:
  - "**/*.test.ts"
  - "**/*.test.tsx"
  - "**/*.spec.ts"
  - "**/*.spec.tsx"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Assert behavior/invariants, not implementation trivia.
- Include denial and failure paths.
- Avoid over-mocking domain logic.
- Contract-test external boundaries.
- Keep fixtures deterministic.
